rable_type' => 'App\\Models\\Profile']);","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Not reversible: the legacy alias is ambiguous and reverting would","+     * reintroduce the morph-type mismatch this migration exists to fix.","+     */","+    public function down(): void","+    {","+        //","+    }","+};"],"additions":49,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/Feature/UserFilter/LegacyProfileBlockMuteTest.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,234 @@","+<?php","+","+use App\\Models\\Profile;","+use App\\Models\\User;","+use App\\Models\\UserFilter;","+use App\\Services\\RelationshipService;","+use App\\Services\\UserFilterService;","+use Illuminate\\Foundation\\Testing\\LazilyRefreshDatabase;","+use Laravel\\Passport\\Passport;","+","+uses(LazilyRefreshDatabase::class);","+","+/*","+|--------------------------------------------------------------------------","+| Legacy morph-type block/mute coverage","+|--------------------------------------------------------------------------","+|","+| Rows written before the model namespace move store filterable_type as the","+| old alias 'App\\Profile' instead of App\\Models\\Profile. Reads and deletes","+| that match only the modern class skipped those rows, so a legacy block or","+| mute reported as inactive and could never be removed. These cases cover","+| the relationship reporter, the unblock/unmute delete paths, the profile","+| id helpers, and the data migration that normalizes the stored value.","+|","+*/","+","+const LEGACY_TYPE = 'App\\Profile';","+","+function seedFilter(int $userId, int $targetId, string $filterType, string $type): UserFilter","+{","+    $filter = new UserFilter;","+    $filter->user_id = $userId;","+    $filter->filterable_id = $targetId;","+    $filter->filterable_type = $type;","+    $filter->filter_type = $filterType;","+    $filter->save();","+","+    return $filter;","+}","+","+function runMorphNormalization(): void","+{","+    $migration = require base_path('database/migrations/2026_10_07_000001_normalize_legacy_user_filter_morph_types.php');","+    $migration->up();","+}","+","+describe('legacy App\\Profile rows', function () {","+    it('reports blocking and muting true for a legacy row', function () {","+        $user = User::factory()->create();","+        $user->refresh();","+        $target = User::factory()->create();","+        $target->refresh();","+","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id, 'block', LEGACY_TYPE);","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id, 'mute', LEGACY_TYPE);","+","+        $rel = RelationshipService::refresh($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id);","+","+        expect($rel['blocking'])->toBeTrue();","+        expect($rel['muting'])->toBeTrue();","+    });","+","+    it('unblocks and deletes a legacy block row', function () {","+        $user = User::factory()->create();","+        $user->refresh();","+        $target = User::factory()->create();","+        $target->refresh();","+","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id, 'block', LEGACY_TYPE);","+        Passport::actingAs($user, ['write']);","+","+        $this->postJson(\"/api/v1/accounts/{$target->profile_id}/unblock\")","+            ->assertOk();","+","+        expect(UserFilter::where('user_id', $user->profile_id)","+            ->where('filterable_id', $target->profile_id)","+            ->where('filter_type', 'block')","+            ->exists()","+        )->toBeFalse();","+    });","+","+    it('unmutes and deletes a legacy mute row', function () {","+        $user = User::factory()->create();","+        $user->refresh();","+        $target = User::factory()->create();","+        $target->refresh();","+","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id, 'mute', LEGACY_TYPE);","+        Passport::actingAs($user, ['write']);","+","+        $this->postJson(\"/api/v1/accounts/{$target->profile_id}/unmute\")","+            ->assertOk();","+","+        expect(UserFilter::where('user_id', $user->profile_id)","+            ->where('filterable_id', $target->profile_id)","+            ->where('filter_type', 'mute')","+            ->exists()","+        )->toBeFalse();","+    });","+","+    it('includes legacy-blocked and legacy-muted ids in the profile helpers', function () {","+        $user = User::factory()->create();","+        $user->refresh();","+        $blocked = User::factory()->create();","+        $blocked->refresh();","+        $muted = User::factory()->create();","+        $muted->refresh();","+","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $blocked->profile_id, 'block', LEGACY_TYPE);","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $muted->profile_id, 'mute', LEGACY_TYPE);","+","+        $profile = Profile::find($user->profile_id);","+","+        expect($profile->blockedIds()->contains($blocked->profile_id))->toBeTrue();","+        expect($profile->mutedIds()->contains($muted->profile_id))->toBeTrue();","+    });","+});","+","+describe('warm cache eviction on legacy row removal', function () {","+    it('evicts a legacy-blocked id from the warm block cache on unblock', function () {","+        $user = User::factory()->create();","+        $user->refresh();","+        $target = User::factory()->create();","+        $target->refresh();","+","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id, 'block', LEGACY_TYPE);","+","+        expect(collect(UserFilterService::blocks($user->profile_id))->map(fn ($i) => (string) $i))","+            ->toContain((string) $target->profile_id);","+","+        Passport::actingAs($user, ['write']);","+        $this->postJson(\"/api/v1/accounts/{$target->profile_id}/unblock\")","+            ->assertOk();","+","+        expect(collect(UserFilterService::blocks($user->profile_id))->map(fn ($i) => (string) $i))","+            ->not->toContain((string) $target->profile_id);","+        expect(UserFilterService::blockCount($user->profile_id))->toBe(0);","+    });","+","+    it('evicts a legacy-muted id from the warm mute cache on unmute', function () {","+        $user = User::factory()->create();","+        $user->refresh();","+        $target = User::factory()->create();","+        $target->refresh();","+","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id, 'mute', LEGACY_TYPE);","+","+        expect(collect(UserFilterService::mutes($user->profile_id))->map(fn ($i) => (string) $i))","+            ->toContain((string) $target->profile_id);","+","+        Passport::actingAs($user, ['write']);","+        $this->postJson(\"/api/v1/accounts/{$target->profile_id}/unmute\")","+            ->assertOk();","+","+        expect(collect(UserFilterService::mutes($user->profile_id))->map(fn ($i) => (string) $i))","+            ->not->toContain((string) $target->profile_id);","+        expect(UserFilterService::muteCount($user->profile_id))->toBe(0);","+    });","+});","+","+describe('modern App\\Models\\Profile control', function () {","+    it('reports and unblocks a modern row identically', function () {","+        $user = User::factory()->create();","+        $user->refresh();","+        $target = User::factory()->create();","+        $target->refresh();","+","+        seedFilter($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id, 'block', Profile::class);","+","+        $rel = RelationshipService::refresh($user->profile_id, $target->profile_id);","+        expect($rel['blocking'])->toBeTrue();","+","+        Passport::actingAs($user, ['write']);","+        $this->postJson(\"/api/v1/accounts/{$target->profile_id}/unblock\")","+            ->assertOk();","+","+        expect(UserFilter::where('user_id', $user->profile_id)","+            ->where('filterable_id', $target->profile_id)","+            ->where('filter_type', 'block')","+            ->exists()","+        )->toBeFalse();","+    });","+});","+","+describe('legacy morph normalization migration', function () {","+    it('normalizes legacy rows, drops colliding duplicates, and keeps distinct pairs', function () {","+        $user = User::factory()->create();","+    